00:23:49,840 --> 00:23:50,946
Sky.

262
00:23:51,502 --> 00:23:55,846
Here, Sky, the sound is gone. Come on, Sky, put your hands together nicely. The sound is gone.

263
00:23:56,166 --> 00:23:56,709
Come on.

264
00:24:06,153 --> 00:24:09,683
Sky, Sky, Sky, what's wrong with you, Sky?

265
00:24:25,880 --> 00:24:27,960
I just saw him doing fine.

266
00:24:30,866 --> 00:24:32,107
How could someone do something like this?

267
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:35,575
They're taking him out.

268
00:24:43,040 --> 00:24:44,657
Who could do such a thing?

269
00:25:08,380 --> 00:25:13,318
Right now, the police are
initially assuming that this may be

270
00:25:13,467 --> 00:25:15,968
The same serial killer that the police are hunting down.

271
00:25:16,040 --> 00:25:19,881
Because the murderer left behind a sheet of knitted yarn
just like in the previous incidents.

272
00:25:20,055 --> 00:25:23,408
If this is true, this will be the fifth body in this case.

273
00:25:23,516 --> 00:25:25,940
Now, people are very afraid.

274
00:25:25,968 --> 00:25:28,240
Because the police themselves
were unable to catch the culprit.

275
00:25:28,360 --> 00:25:30,758
Social trends are asking government officials

276
00:25:30,789 --> 00:25:33,760
How many more deaths will have to occur before the criminals are caught.

277
00:25:33,798 --> 00:25:35,575
And how will the people live?

278
00:25:55,300 --> 00:25:58,194
Phra Phongsak Phonpanyawat, 64 years old

279
00:25:58,678 --> 00:26:00,667
The autopsy begins at 10:10 a.m.

280
00:26:02,483 --> 00:26:03,314
Hold on.

281
00:26:04,062 --> 00:26:04,612
What

282
00:26:05,269 --> 00:26:07,001
Are you going to do the autopsy yourself?

283
00:26:07,419 --> 00:26:08,024
Why?

284
00:26:08,733 --> 00:26:09,916
Well, you're a woman.

285
00:26:11,227 --> 00:26:12,076
So what?

286
00:26:12,580 --> 00:26:14,243
As a woman, how can you touch a monk?

287
00:26:14,424 --> 00:26:17,123
You'll go to hell. I'm worried about you.

288
00:26:17,906 --> 00:26:19,801
This is a corpse, not a monk.

289
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,288
Fine.

290
00:26:23,224 --> 00:26:23,980
Such a sin.

291
00:26:24,410 --> 00:26:28,514
Do whatever you have to do.
If it's a sin, then I'm the only one who sins.

292
00:26:31,321 --> 00:26:31,996
Take a photo.

293
00:27:05,634 --> 00:27:07,120
Arms are full of needle marks.

294
00:27:25,311 --> 00:27:26,566
There are scars on the face.

295
00:27:27,829 --> 00:27:28,622
Take a photo here.

296
00:27:32,640 --> 00:27:36,135
Underneath the facial skin is not smooth.
It feels like there is something under the skin.

297
00:27:37,568 --> 00:27:38,646
What is it, sis?

298
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:42,859
The skin has a wavy texture.

299
00:27:45,627 --> 00:27:47,739
There are wavy marks under the skin.

300
00:28:09,036 --> 00:28:09,826
How is it?

301
00:28:10,657 --> 00:28:12,660
So you did the autopsy yourself?

302
00:28:13,620 --> 00:28:17,179
Yes, she did it herself, Inspector.
I told her not to, but she wouldn't listen.

303
00:28:17,826 --> 00:28:20,013
You'll get internet backlash for breaking the rules of monks.

304
00:28:21,297 --> 00:28:24,619
Actually, the Venerable Monk had broken the rules way before that already.

305
00:28:28,525 --> 00:28:29,980
Preliminary autopsy results.

306
00:28:31,579 --> 00:28:32,824
Just look at it yourself.

307
00:28:34,073 --> 00:28:35,582
We cannot call him a monk anymore.

308
00:28:35,980 --> 00:28:38,626
The face was cut open
and the dermal filler came out like jelly.

309
00:28:40,650 --> 00:28:42,076
Look at the X-ray film.

310
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:44,316
What is this?

311
00:28:45,227 --> 00:28:46,907
A facelift thread.

312
00:28:48,076 --> 00:28:50,956
That's why the Venerable
Monk has an aura of a face full of merit.

313
00:28:51,245 --> 00:28:54,139
It's not because of any merit or virtue.

314
00:28:55,940 --> 00:28:57,050
Glutathione.

315
00:28:58,361 --> 00:28:59,502
This Venerable Monk?

316
00:28:59,980 --> 00:29:01,401
Better say Venerable Nun.

317
00:29:02,333 --> 00:29:05,384
- Wait... Wait a minute, An. What is this?
- Inspector, sir.

318
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:08,380
I found something in the monk's hut.

319
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:12,800
(3 hours ago)

320
00:29:32,520 --> 00:29:33,349
What is it?

321
00:29:45,349 --> 00:29:46,780
Why did the monk keep these things?

322
00:29:47,645 --> 00:29:49,346
I think he's saving it for his mother.

323
00:30:11,916 --> 00:30:14,097
-Hurry up and get it unlocked.
-Understood.

324
00:30:17,714 --> 00:30:19,387
This is what's in the phone.

325
00:30:25,293 --> 00:30:27,238
-What?
-What?

326
00:30:32,111 --> 00:30:34,780
The third crown for Miss Tiffany is coming.

327
00:30:35,332 --> 00:30:38,142
You see, she was really a nun as I said.

328
00:30:38,699 --> 00:30:39,958
It doesn't end there.

329
00:30:40,566 --> 00:30:43,805
I have questioned the temple boys.
The temple boys said that...

330
00:30:55,760 --> 00:30:57,415
- Hello.
- Come in.

331
00:31:14,326 --> 00:31:15,697
What should we do this time?

332
00:31:17,495 --> 00:31:18,827
Give me everything, Bossy!

333
00:31:19,314 --> 00:31:22,528
It's almost the big Buddhist holy day.
I have to meet the fans

334
00:31:22,598 --> 00:31:24,076
and many disciples.

335
00:31:24,413 --> 00:31:29,773
If my skin is not radiant and flawless,
People will gossip that I don't have enough merit.

336
00:31:30,229 --> 00:31:33,370
Then I'll prepare the gluta
for you and give you a full dose.

337
00:31:33,520 --> 00:31:38,890
And then add a vitamin drip.
I guarantee that the aura will be so bright like...

338
00:31:38,963 --> 00:31:40,664
a glitter.

339
00:31:41,593 --> 00:31:42,918
It's awesome.

340
00:31:42,963 --> 00:31:48,048
Give it to me. Give me everything.
Come on. Now, I am very ready.

341
00:31:48,120 --> 00:31:49,160
Come on! Come on!

342
00:31:49,283 --> 00:31:50,803
Okay, let's go.

343
00:31:50,873 --> 00:31:53,596
I'll add some dermal filler for orange cheeks.

344
00:31:53,840 --> 00:31:56,747
And a little bit under the eyes
and a little bit on the laugh lines.

345
00:31:57,008 --> 00:32:00,720
I assure you that your face
will definitely have a dimension of merit.

346
00:32:01,450 --> 00:32:06,824
Great. May the merit from this time
bring prosperity to Bossy.

347
00:32:06,991 --> 00:32:09,920
Have radiant skin like mine.

348
00:32:11,349 --> 00:32:12,678
Come on, Bossy.

349
00:32:14,820 --> 00:32:17,923
Got it, then it matches the cause of death.

350
00:32:18,702 --> 00:32:22,504
She died because of the dermal
filler used for cosmetic injections.

351
00:32:23,213 --> 00:32:24,191
Dermal filler?

352
00:32:26,003 --> 00:32:30,459
The murderer injected a large amount of filler into the bridge of his nose.

353
00:32:30,859 --> 00:32:33,394
Until it blocked the blood vessels
in the brain, causing death.

354
00:32:35,370 --> 00:32:36,535
This is psycho.

355
00:32:36,873 --> 00:32:40,041
Then the number one suspect right now
must be that quack doctor.

356
00:32:40,706 --> 00:32:41,867
Right!

357
00:32:42,716 --> 00:32:44,646
The suspect has medical knowledge.

358
00:32:45,067 --> 00:32:47,092
There is a picture of that doctor on the monk's phone.

359
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:51,916
The temple boy confirmed
that this was a quack doctor named Boss.

360
00:32:57,391 --> 00:32:59,360
- Investigate about him.
- Understood.

361
00:33:36,946 --> 00:33:37,808
Sir.

362
00:33:38,431 --> 00:33:39,346
What's up, Sergeant?

363
00:33:40,507 --> 00:33:41,822
The profile of the quack doctor.

364
00:33:42,600 --> 00:33:44,521
He has murder genes.

365
00:33:52,751 --> 00:33:54,236
- Go, Sergeant.
- Right.

366
00:33:58,040 --> 00:34:03,405
Police have now found clues to the serial killer

367
00:34:03,499 --> 00:34:07,387
With a new report confirming
that the suspect has murder genes.

368
00:34:11,071 --> 00:34:13,387
What are you watching, Sky?

369
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:16,740
Let me watch it.

370
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:18,240
- Sky will watch.
- What are you watching?

371
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:20,320
There are only stressful things. No more.

372
00:34:20,511 --> 00:34:23,640
- Don't watch it, Sky.
- Please give me the remote. Sky will watch.

373
00:34:31,238 --> 00:34:32,400
Do you know the people in this picture?

374
00:34:39,916 --> 00:34:40,953
Is there something wrong?

375
00:34:41,526 --> 00:34:42,525
Miss Sookwan.

376
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:45,206
Do you know this person?

377
00:34:47,266 --> 00:34:50,173
This is a picture of Boss.
Boss is the person who rents our house.

378
00:34:53,384 --> 00:34:57,240
Sky, sit here. I will go talk to the police.

379
00:35:16,080 --> 00:35:20,080
Boss has been renting my house for many years.

380
00:35:20,438 --> 00:35:21,926
But I don't know much about him.

381
00:35:22,080 --> 00:35:25,245
When he pays the rent, he pays through an app.

382
00:35:25,363 --> 00:35:26,960
We don't meet often.

383
00:35:27,446 --> 00:35:28,650
Is there something wrong?

384
00:35:29,276 --> 00:35:32,271
Now, Boss is the suspect in a serial murder case.

385
00:35:44,200 --> 00:35:45,000
Ouch!

386
00:36:39,000 --> 00:36:39,721
Open the door!

387
00:36:40,320 --> 00:36:41,120
This is the police.

388
00:36:46,831 --> 00:36:47,680
Open the door!

389
00:36:49,640 --> 00:36:50,438
Open the door!

390
00:37:11,725 --> 00:37:13,000
Hey, stop!

391
00:37:14,900 --> 00:37:16,280
Boss, I told you to stop.

392
00:37:18,080 --> 00:37:19,600
- Follow him.
- Okay.

393
00:37:33,617 --> 00:37:34,292
Hey!

394
00:37:42,873 --> 00:37:43,728
Fuck!

395
00:37:44,066 --> 00:37:46,200
- Sergeant, call an ambulance right away.
- Okay.

396
00:37:55,426 --> 00:37:57,798
The press conference said that the serial killer was dead.

397
00:37:58,780 --> 00:38:01,029
I think we can't conclude that yet, sir.

398
00:38:01,339 --> 00:38:01,794
What?

399
00:38:02,643 --> 00:38:05,940
Why? You wrote the report yourself.

400
00:38:06,793 --> 00:38:08,650
Indeed, Boss is related to Phra Phongsak.

401
00:38:09,168 --> 00:38:10,619
But he is just a suspect.

402
00:38:11,325 --> 00:38:13,840
Because we still don't have any evidence to confirm that Boss is the murderer.

403
00:38:14,956 --> 00:38:19,000
In the previous cases,
there was no connection or motive at all.

404
00:38:19,113 --> 00:38:22,020
The murder genes are the connection point.

405
00:38:22,406 --> 00:38:26,840
Your father told us that these people
can kill without any reason at all.

406
00:38:27,158 --> 00:38:29,457
But we need proof, don't we, sir?

407
00:38:29,874 --> 00:38:33,640
The officer at Boss's house has already reported back
that no yarn has been found

408
00:38:34,066 --> 00:38:35,895
or even a single piece of knitting equipment.

409
00:38:36,031 --> 00:38:38,880
What kind of murderer
would leave evidence in their own room?

410
00:38:39,836 --> 00:38:40,360
Sir,

411
00:38:41,739 --> 00:38:44,831
I would like to confirm that
we still cannot close this case.

412
00:38:45,206 --> 00:38:47,081
But I ordered it to be closed. That's it.

413
00:38:48,400 --> 00:38:49,120
You can go out now.

414
00:38:50,278 --> 00:38:51,360
What are you doing standing there?

415
00:38:54,480 --> 00:38:55,240
Yes, sir.

416
00:39:54,240 --> 00:39:54,840
What's up, An?

417
00:39:56,236 --> 00:39:57,746
Okay, I'll be there.

418
00:40:02,535 --> 00:40:06,240
Boss's hands are soft and smooth,
without even a single scratch.

419
00:40:06,956 --> 00:40:10,240
Normally, people who knit will have marks on their fingers.

420
00:40:10,780 --> 00:40:15,273
The more the criminal knits that much yarn,
the more skilled he must be.

421
00:40:16,160 --> 00:40:17,436
It means that you have done a lot of work.

422
00:40:17,721 --> 00:40:20,622
Hands can't be so spotless.

423
00:40:23,412 --> 00:40:25,001
An is trying to tell me that...

424
00:40:26,257 --> 00:40:27,655
It's just an assumption.

425
00:40:28,017 --> 00:40:30,793
Did Boss have someone else knit it for him?

426
00:40:31,725 --> 00:40:32,876
But I don't believe that.

427
00:40:35,081 --> 00:40:37,680
Why did he have to run away
from the police if he wasn't a bad guy?

428
00:40:38,427 --> 00:40:40,034
He's not a murderer.

429
00:40:40,455 --> 00:40:41,680
But he is guilty of charges.

430
00:40:42,048 --> 00:40:44,118
First, he is a quack doctor.

431
00:40:44,793 --> 00:40:49,000
Second, he is a person with murder genes
who was outside during curfew.

432
00:40:49,620 --> 00:40:51,474
The punishment is already severe for the second charge.

433
00:40:57,725 --> 00:40:59,234
Why don't you look surprised?

434
00:41:00,240 --> 00:41:02,580
I don't think that Boss is the real murderer either.

435
00:41:03,580 --> 00:41:04,149
Hey!

436
00:41:04,852 --> 00:41:05,680
If Boss wasn't a murderer,

437
00:41:06,772 --> 00:41:08,956
this means there must be more victims, Inspector.

438
00:41:10,083 --> 00:41:10,780
Who could possibly be?

439
00:41:14,198 --> 00:41:16,657
The riddle on the yarn, have you decoded it yet?

440
00:41:17,060 --> 00:41:18,434
What's the riddle, Inspector?

441
00:41:22,038 --> 00:41:23,659
I've tried but I have no clue.

442
00:41:24,852 --> 00:41:28,733
Because this riddle is not Morse code like every other time.

443
00:41:29,210 --> 00:41:30,069
What?

444
00:41:31,940 --> 00:41:32,911
So what should we do?

445
00:41:43,064 --> 00:41:45,906
I would like to ask Sky to decode it for me once more.

446
00:41:46,780 --> 00:41:50,720
What else do you want to decode? You said you had already caught the culprit.

447
00:41:51,540 --> 00:41:53,846
Well, it's like this, Ms. Sookwan.

448
00:41:53,960 --> 00:41:55,360
I want to prove something.

449
00:41:55,683 --> 00:41:58,500
It won't take long.
I just want Sky to help me check it out.

450
00:41:59,026 --> 00:42:02,139
Is there a code or just some letters on the sheet?

451
00:42:02,441 --> 00:42:03,951
Sky isn't coming today.

452
00:42:04,396 --> 00:42:08,431
Mom, Sky's here. Sky's here. Sky's here...

453
00:42:21,335 --> 00:42:22,914
You said Sky wouldn't come.

454
00:42:23,182 --> 00:42:27,544
I would. Sky comes to help mother
every day from 12 to 7.

455
00:42:27,690 --> 00:42:29,160
Sky comes every day.

456
00:42:29,707 --> 00:42:32,716
If you have any questions,
ask her quickly so you guys can leave.

457
00:42:34,504 --> 00:42:35,478
It's like this, Sky.

458
00:42:36,507 --> 00:42:38,907
I have a code and I'd like Sky to help me look at it.

459
00:42:40,914 --> 00:42:42,782
What does it mean? Excuse me.

460
00:42:55,638 --> 00:42:56,664
Braille.

461
00:42:56,920 --> 00:42:58,420
It is a form of written language for blind people.

462
00:42:58,480 --> 00:43:01,180
Invented by Louis Braille, a French blind teacher.

463
00:43:01,366 --> 00:43:04,855
Braille is derived from his last name.
It has the appearance of small raised dots.

464
00:43:05,040 --> 00:43:07,080
In one cell there are six dots.

465
00:43:07,245 --> 00:43:09,826
They are arranged alternately to form a code instead of letters.

466
00:43:16,840 --> 00:43:17,490
Right.

467
00:43:54,222 --> 00:43:56,758
-What does it say, Sky?
-Morons...

468
00:43:57,485 --> 00:43:57,996
Huh?

469
00:43:58,066 --> 00:44:00,222
Morons need help from a retard kid.

470
00:44:01,033 --> 00:44:03,867
Hey, are you really insulting the police inspector?

471
00:44:04,452 --> 00:44:07,892
Hey, didn't you ask Sky what the culprit said?

472
00:44:08,271 --> 00:44:09,405
And Sky already said it.

473
00:44:09,913 --> 00:44:11,269
What did they say, Sky?

474
00:44:12,236 --> 00:44:14,434
Morons need help from a retard kid.

475
00:44:14,890 --> 00:44:17,160
Morons need help from a retard kid.

476
00:44:17,596 --> 00:44:19,443
Morons need help from a retard kid.

477
00:44:19,516 --> 00:44:22,205
Yeah, yeah, I know. No need to keep repeating it.

478
00:44:24,480 --> 00:44:25,080
Sis.

479
00:44:26,653 --> 00:44:28,120
She didn't mean to insult us, right?

480
00:44:28,914 --> 00:44:30,431
The autistic children don't lie.

481
00:44:32,215 --> 00:44:33,930
And is there anything else, Sky?

482
00:44:34,361 --> 00:44:35,224
Any more hints?

483
00:44:41,840 --> 00:44:45,580
5/10, not coffee with cher, who am I?

484
00:44:46,660 --> 00:44:49,217
"Not coffee with cher, who am I?"

485
00:44:59,064 --> 00:45:00,040
- Teacher?
- Teacher?

486
00:45:28,455 --> 00:45:32,507
I hope that you all come here for the last time.

487
00:45:32,789 --> 00:45:33,720
But Miss Sookwan.

488
00:45:34,360 --> 00:45:36,695
If the dead culprit was not the real murderer,

489
00:45:36,840 --> 00:45:40,153
we could all be victims,
including you and your daughter.

490
00:45:41,224 --> 00:45:43,850
And what was that press conference you were holding?

491
00:45:44,198 --> 00:45:45,335
Are you fooling the people?

492
00:45:48,462 --> 00:45:52,198
If that's the case,
you guys shouldn't come back here again.

493
00:45:52,681 --> 00:45:55,478
Because it will cause trouble for me and my child.

494
00:45:59,843 --> 00:46:00,640
She's so mean.

495
00:46:02,448 --> 00:46:03,798
She's worried about her daughter.

496
00:46:04,285 --> 00:46:06,100
Parents who have children like this

497
00:46:06,351 --> 00:46:08,671
probably don't want their children
to get involved with a lot of people.

498
00:46:09,640 --> 00:46:13,290
She was afraid that something might happen
and trigger the child's symptoms.

499
00:46:14,240 --> 00:46:17,464
But at least we now know that
the next victim is likely to be a teacher.

500
00:46:18,280 --> 00:46:19,180
Then what will you do?

501
00:46:25,321 --> 00:46:28,780
Lan, what's with him? Why doesn't he talk to me?

502
00:46:33,120 --> 00:46:33,874
Ouch!

503
00:46:41,126 --> 00:46:41,801
Hey!

504
00:46:43,180 --> 00:46:46,240
I have already announced the closing of the Yarn Murder case.
Are you going to continue?

505
00:46:46,622 --> 00:46:48,584
Do you dare to disobey your superior's orders?

506
00:46:49,099 --> 00:46:51,728
Between losing face and having more people die.

507
00:46:51,947 --> 00:46:52,984
What would you choose?

508
00:46:57,920 --> 00:46:58,946
I will not lose face.

509
00:47:01,144 --> 00:47:02,525
And I won't let anyone else die.

510
00:47:06,987 --> 00:47:09,923
Do whatever you want, but you have to know...

511
00:47:10,459 --> 00:47:11,558
that if this case does not end,

512
00:47:12,100 --> 00:47:13,526
the one who lost face is your father.

513
00:47:14,170 --> 00:47:17,346
I will monitor every school as much as I can.

514
00:47:26,838 --> 00:47:27,895
Just be careful.

515
00:47:28,584 --> 00:47:30,240
Don't let it slip through the ears of reporters.

516
00:47:30,935 --> 00:47:32,191
I don't want people to panic.

517
00:47:34,667 --> 00:47:36,038
Does that mean you believe me?

518
00:47:37,008 --> 00:47:38,946
But you can leave now. I don't want to complain to you.

519
00:48:02,080 --> 00:48:07,280
Here is all the information that you ordered, both about Sookwan and her daughter.

520
00:48:07,589 --> 00:48:11,735
Including all the victims, how many children, how many wives, how many secret lovers

521
00:48:11,944 --> 00:48:15,217
Weight, height, medical history, birthplace.

522
00:48:15,321 --> 00:48:19,095
What school did they attend,
what was their GPA, I give you everything.

523
00:48:22,003 --> 00:48:24,274
Thanks, Sergeant. I'll read the rest myself.

524
00:48:25,443 --> 00:48:25,944
Alright.

525
00:48:26,733 --> 00:48:27,836
Oh, Inspector.

526
00:48:28,323 --> 00:48:29,926
I have something to tell you.

527
00:48:32,240 --> 00:48:35,120
Miss Sookwan used to be an operating room nurse.

528
00:48:58,280 --> 00:49:02,893
Yes, knitting is about inserting a stitch into a loop.

529
00:49:03,640 --> 00:49:08,380
Then pull the yarn to the end and slowly pull the yarn out.

530
00:49:08,594 --> 00:49:09,624
When we do the purl stitch.

531
00:49:09,740 --> 00:49:13,645
We have to pull the yarn forward
and then insert it upwards.

532
00:49:14,295 --> 00:49:16,699
Wrap the yarn, pull out the yarn

533
00:49:17,026 --> 00:49:17,980
and this is the purl stitch.

534
00:49:18,438 --> 00:49:20,100
But if there is a pattern,

535
00:49:20,257 --> 00:49:23,874
It depends on how the stick
is inserted up and down or how the yarn is wrapped.

536
00:49:23,933 --> 00:49:25,033
And it will make patterns.

537
00:49:25,276 --> 00:49:29,053
It's similar to tying a knot with a yarn.
It's also a way to create a pattern.

538
00:49:29,589 --> 00:49:30,452
Do you understand?

539
00:49:30,775 --> 00:49:32,086
Let's try it.

540
00:49:32,584 --> 00:49:33,843
Are you starting the knit?

541
00:49:34,427 --> 00:49:37,906
Ah, let's try it. I will check on each table.

542
00:49:38,518 --> 00:49:39,913
Let's see if you can do it.

543
00:49:41,551 --> 00:49:43,558
Hmm, is this one knitted?

544
00:49:45,714 --> 00:49:49,332
Thank you very much, Ms. Sookwan,
for being a special teacher for our school.

545
00:49:50,288 --> 00:49:51,147
My pleasure.

546
00:49:51,833 --> 00:49:55,819
I am delighted that you have agreed
to be my special speaker today.

547
00:49:56,720 --> 00:49:58,848
Thank you for not dwelling on the past.

548
00:50:00,040 --> 00:50:02,285
Let bygones be bygones.

549
00:50:04,546 --> 00:50:05,349
Agreed.

550
00:50:06,160 --> 00:50:07,485
But before I can get through it,

551
00:50:07,798 --> 00:50:09,627
it's quite difficult, Miss.

552
00:50:12,166 --> 00:50:13,286
But don't worry.

553
00:50:15,080 --> 00:50:17,161
I've forgotten all about it.

554
00:50:23,787 --> 00:50:25,015
Thank you again.

555
00:50:25,603 --> 00:50:26,782
Next time...

556
00:50:27,580 --> 00:50:28,780
Please bring Sky along.

557
00:50:30,720 --> 00:50:32,380
Sky probably doesn't want to come.

558
00:50:35,050 --> 00:50:36,201
I must leave now.

559
00:50:51,640 --> 00:50:54,326
Sorry, darling, there was a lot of traffic.

560
00:50:56,469 --> 00:50:57,620
Before I arrive,

561
00:50:58,490 --> 00:50:59,947
whom were you talking to?

562
00:51:02,469 --> 00:51:03,693
Miss Sookwan.

563
00:51:04,372 --> 00:51:07,151
She came to help as a special teacher
teaching Handicrafts.

564
00:51:08,278 --> 00:51:11,575
Miss Sookwan is very good at knitting.

565
00:51:23,544 --> 00:51:24,347
Let's go.

566
00:51:53,753 --> 00:51:55,419
-Hello.
-Hello.

567
00:51:55,846 --> 00:51:57,401
Is Isriya here?

568
00:51:57,742 --> 00:52:00,859
Oh, she's not here.
She hasn't come to work for several days now.

569
00:52:01,116 --> 00:52:02,410
Is there something wrong?

570
00:52:46,156 --> 00:52:49,732
This is the yarn that Ya ordered.
I collected it and gave it to you.

571
00:52:52,351 --> 00:52:53,613
I'm sorry for your loss.

572
00:52:54,810 --> 00:52:56,970
- Thank you very much.
- We'd better get going.

573
00:53:29,422 --> 00:53:32,720
This is what the shop owner came to give me.

574
00:53:38,285 --> 00:53:40,372
Was Mr. Isriya close to the owner of the shop?

575
00:53:40,612 --> 00:53:42,486
She liked knitting.

576
00:53:42,859 --> 00:53:44,921
When she had free time, she knitted for people around her.

577
00:53:45,332 --> 00:53:47,144
I also found out about this from her friends.

578
00:53:47,638 --> 00:53:50,427
They said that she often went to buy things at this store.

579
00:53:53,610 --> 00:53:54,994
I'm sorry to ask.

580
00:53:55,474 --> 00:54:00,598
Did the shop owner say anything about your daughter?

581
00:54:01,220 --> 00:54:03,933
She came to give her condolences

582
00:54:04,180 --> 00:54:06,890
and gave me the yarn that Ya ordered.

583
00:54:14,893 --> 00:54:15,860
Thank you very much.

584
00:54:39,080 --> 00:54:40,160
These two people

585
00:54:42,100 --> 00:54:43,853
studied at Arunpanya School.

586
00:54:45,422 --> 00:54:47,415
Sky also studied here.

587
00:54:50,208 --> 00:54:53,892
- It's an incredible coincidence.
- Such a suspicious coincidence.

588
00:54:54,695 --> 00:54:56,180
And the digger we deep,

589
00:54:56,660 --> 00:55:00,194
the more everything is connected
to Sky and Sookwan.

590
00:55:03,450 --> 00:55:05,370
The victims died of medical techniques.

591
00:55:05,980 --> 00:55:07,930
Miss Sookwan used to be a nurse.

592
00:55:08,678 --> 00:55:10,688
Each victim had a sheet of yarn with a riddle.

593
00:55:11,460 --> 00:55:14,292
Sky is the only one who can understand.

594
00:55:20,200 --> 00:55:24,048
Two of the five victims knew the mother and daughter.

595
00:55:28,695 --> 00:55:32,580
Sergeant, I'd like you to go ask Rapee if...

596
00:55:32,977 --> 00:55:36,253
-she knows Miss Sookwan.
-Wow!

597
00:55:36,730 --> 00:55:37,662
No need at all.

598
00:55:37,906 --> 00:55:41,064
Yesterday I saw Miss Sookwan talking with my wife at school.

599
00:55:41,419 --> 00:55:44,963
I remember Rapee said that
Miss Sookwan is a special teacher there.

600
00:56:30,038 --> 00:56:34,452
Sky, where are you going in such a hurry?
Sky, come help me carry the stuff first.

601
00:56:48,977 --> 00:56:49,728
Sky.

602
00:56:50,994 --> 00:56:52,695
Sky.

603
00:56:53,443 --> 00:56:54,838
What are you doing here?

604
00:56:55,429 --> 00:56:56,570
What's wrong with you?

605
00:56:57,617 --> 00:56:59,850
Sky, why do you act so weird, sweetheart?

606
00:57:00,441 --> 00:57:01,544
Sky.

607
00:57:13,401 --> 00:57:15,318
I know she deserves this.
